---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { SITE, url } from '../lib/site';
---

<Legal title="Cancellation and refund policy" description={`How an ${SITE.name} trial and prepaid plan end, and when you get a refund.`} updated="5 October 2026">
  <p>
    This policy covers payments to {SITE.legalName} for {SITE.name} subscriptions and credit top-ups. Payments are processed by our payment partner (Cashfree Payments); we never see or store your full card details.
  </p>

  <h2>Free trial</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every plan starts with a 7-day trial. To start it we check your debit or credit card with a ₹1 payment.</li>
    <li>The ₹1 is refunded automatically as soon as the check succeeds; it normally reaches your card within 5–7 business days.</li>
    <li>Nothing is charged when the trial ends. To continue, choose a plan and pay for it in Plan &amp; Billing; otherwise the trial simply ends.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Ending a plan</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Plans are prepaid for a month or a year and never renew automatically, so there is nothing to cancel: if you don't renew, your plan ends with the period you paid for. You can also email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a> from your account email.</li>
    <li>Your plan stays active, with its credits, until the end of the period you already paid for. There is no fee for not renewing.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Monthly plans:</b> a month that has started is not refunded, and there are no refunds for partly used months.</li>
    <li><b>Annual plans:</b> if you ask within 7 days of an annual payment, we refund it, minus the credits you used at the top-up rate. After 7 days, the plan runs to the end of the paid year.</li>
    <li><b>Credit top-ups:</b> an unused top-up pack can be refunded within 7 days of purchase. A pack that has been partly used is not refundable.</li>
    <li><b>Work already delivered:</b> credits spent on posts, images, articles and other content that was generated, and posts already published, are not refundable, as with any marketing service already performed.</li>
    <li><b>Always refunded in full:</b> a duplicate charge, a charge you did not make yourself, or a charge for a period in which the service was unavailable to you because of a fault on our side.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How to ask for a refund</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a> from your account email with the payment ID or invoice number and the reason. We reply within two business days.
    Approved refunds go back to the original payment method and normally reach you within 5–7 business days, depending on your bank.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    See also our <a href={url('/terms')}>terms of service</a> and <a href={url('/delivery-policy')}>service delivery policy</a>, or <a href={url('/contact')}>contact us</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
